{
    "id": "email-to-trilium@beatlink",
    "name": "Email to Trilium",
    "description": "Multi-account email inbox for TriliumNext. Connects to Gmail and Microsoft (Outlook) accounts over their HTTP APIs, lists recent messages in a render view, and lets you turn any email into a note (subject + HTML body + attachments) filed under a per-account target note, or delete it from the mail account.",
